# Tool credentials for this skill (all OPTIONAL — never block a run).
# Bind each to a Vault item in the Designer's Environment tab.
# The skill works as pure knowledge with none bound; CLIs activate when keys are set.

# google-ads (CLI: google-ads.js)
GOOGLE_ADS_CUSTOMER_ID
GOOGLE_ADS_DEVELOPER_TOKEN
#   GOOGLE_ADS_TOKEN: OAuth access token — expires; refresh out-of-band
GOOGLE_ADS_TOKEN
# linkedin-ads (CLI: linkedin-ads.js)
#   LINKEDIN_ACCESS_TOKEN: OAuth access token — expires; refresh out-of-band
LINKEDIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
# meta-ads (CLI: meta-ads.js)
#   META_ACCESS_TOKEN: OAuth access token — expires; refresh out-of-band
META_ACCESS_TOKEN
META_AD_ACCOUNT_ID
# tiktok-ads (CLI: tiktok-ads.js)
#   TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN: OAuth access token — expires; refresh out-of-band
TIKTOK_ACCESS_TOKEN
TIKTOK_ADVERTISER_ID
